Replace everything in the CodePen **HTML** box with this:

```html
<h1>🧡 Jumping Orange Cat Catches Sky Fish 🐟</h1>
<p>Move with ← →. Jump with ↑ or Space. Catch fish, avoid shoes and bombs!</p>
<canvas id="game" width="600" height="400"></canvas>

<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #bdefff;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    text-align: center;
  }

  canvas {
    background: linear-gradient(#8fd3ff, #e9fbff);
    border: 4px solid #333;
    border-radius: 12px;
